			"notes": "## Content\n\n- fuel bucket now contains an actual fluid which can be placed in the world\n- added new fermenting process which can be used to craft buckets of fuel. Check out the newly created tag: `boatism/tags/items/fermentable` for its ingredients, next to water.\n- Most fluid and item storages are now compatible with Fabric's Transfer API. This should make compatibility with storage and production mods easier to implement in the future\n\n## Warning\n\nThis is a pre-release which is mostly intended for testing purpose. If you want to give it a try, make sure to back up your world. Elements will eventually be tweaked to improve and fix many UX issues.\n\nStarting with this release, this mod will now support multiple Fabric versions."
		},
