			"notes": "## Content\n\n- added new warnings for the user when the engine changes states\n\n## Fixes\n\n- completely changed the movement system\n- fixed many sound handling issues\n- fixed item rendering and item handling\n\n## Note\n\nChanges to the API have been made!\n\nThe movement is handled using Mixins instead of Entity based ticks now. If your mod adds compatibility but also applies custom movement, you might want to check out the [API documentation](https://github.com/JR1811/Boatism/tree/master/src/main/java/net/shirojr/boatism/api), if the boat and / or the engine don't behave as intended."
